<PageLayout title="Colophon" description="How this site is built.">
  <p>Rooted in the soil of static HTML, reaching for the sun with almost no JavaScript.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Astro (static output) in plain JavaScript</li>
    <li>React islands for interactive demos</li>
    <li>MDX for tutorials, Markdown elsewhere</li>
    <li>Open Props tokens and hand-written CSS</li>
    <li>Inter and JetBrains Mono, self-hosted via Fontsource</li>
    <li>Hosted on Vercel</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
